# Detect certutil.exe used as an ingress tool transfer utility
#
# Tactic: Command and Control (TA0011)
# Technique: T1105 - Ingress Tool Transfer
# Data source: Rapid7 InsightIDR
#
# ICONTAINS-ALL matches command lines containing every listed substring,
# case-insensitively. This is preferred over a quoted regex, which would
# match the literal quote characters rather than the switch text.

where(process.name = "certutil.exe" AND process.cmd_line ICONTAINS-ALL ["-urlcache", "-split"])
